{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Jacob called to his sons</b> — He wished to reveal to them the End, but it was hidden from him. Jacob said: Perhaps there is sin (חט) among you. They said to him: Examine our names and you will not find in them the letters חט. He said to them: Also the letters קץ are not in them."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:37.215938171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}